OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe new week will start dry
OL,6,Fwith hot spells of sunshine developing
OL,7,Fthrough the morning and early
OL,8,Fafternoon. However, later in the day
OL,9,Fcloud will increase from the southwest
OL,10,Fwith the chance of some sharp showers
OL,11,Fbreaking out.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will be a rather cloudy
OL,14,Fevening with the chance of a few more
OL,15,Fshowers developing, especially in the
OL,16,Fnorth. Overnight though it will become
OL,17,Fdry with some clearer spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
